# The torn-site build has mixed CRLF/LF line endings from its own build tool.
# It must be stored byte-exact so it always matches the served/canonical build
# (checked on every update); autocrlf normalization would silently corrupt it.
ordinary-torn-site/index.html -text

# 3D models are binary; never touch their bytes.
*.glb binary
# Stored byte-exact so GitHub Pages serves exactly the canonical build.
ak47-field-strip/index.html -text
*.mp3 binary
# Stored byte-exact (source has mixed CRLF/LF) so GitHub Pages serves the canonical build.
sled-free-deepseek/index.html -text
# Stored byte-exact so GitHub Pages serves the canonical build (and its two mp3s untouched).
diablo-idle-deepseek/index.html -text
diablo-idle-deepseek/*.mp3 binary
